infection. METHOD 843 HIV-infected patients were screened and 545 enrolled in the study. Eligible adults (with HIV-1 or 
HIV-1 and HIV-2 dual seropositivity at stages 2 or 3 of the WHO staging system) received co-trimoxazole chemoprophylaxis
