status from an earlier perinatal intervention trial were enrolled during the first year of life and followed to 
approximately 36 months of age. OUTCOME MEASURES Morbidity and mortality information was collected every 3 months by a 
questionnaire. A physical examination was conducted every 6 months. Blood to determine CD4(+) values was also collected.
